r-healthcare/hr-prof-liab.md","line":98},{"title":"reference","target":"reference-hr-service-delivery-advanced-integration-with-workday","line":105},{"title":"Professional reference form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-professional-ref.md","line":123},{"title":"Professional speciality form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hc-prof-spec.md","line":148},{"title":"Malpractice history form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-mal-his.md","line":198},{"title":"Education and Training form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-edu-tra.md","line":223},{"title":"Employment history form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-emp-det.md","line":248},{"title":"Languages Spoken form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-emp-lan.md","line":273},{"title":"Hospital Affiliations form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-hos-aff.md","line":302},{"title":"Payers Enrollment form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-payer-en.md","line":334},{"title":"Hiring","target":"hiring-tab-concept","line":340},{"title":"Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"agent-ws-hr-case-mgmt-landing-page","line":341},{"title":"Healthcare Employee Onboarding form","target":"hr-emp-onboarding","line":342},{"title":"Employee Center","target":"employee-center-landing-page","line":343},{"title":"Reference","target":"reference-hr-service-delivery-advanced-integration-with-workday","line":344}],"metadata":{"title":"Healthcare Professional data model","description":"The Healthcare Professional data model stores confidential HR data, such as name, personal contact information, email addresses, professional liability insurance details, medical degree and employment history healthcare professional, previous employment history.Auto-create a healthcare professional profile when a manager or an hiring agent places an onboarding request for a healthcare professional. Store the details of the health care professional by maintaining strict edit or view permissions.Store the professional ID details that a healthcare professional provides via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Store the professional liability insurance details that a healthcare professional provides via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Store the professional reference details that a healthcare professional provides via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Store details of the healthcare area in which the healthcare professional specialises and has obtained the required trainings and certifications. These details are provided by healthcare professional via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Record practice location details of the healthcare professional. The healthcare professional provides these details via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Record Malpractice claim history of the healthcare professional. The healthcare professional provides these details via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Record education and training details of the healthcare professional. The healthcare professional provides these details via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Store employment history details of the healthcare professional. The healthcare professional provides these details via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Record languages spoken by the healthcare professional. The healthcare professional provides these details via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Record the hospital affiliation details of healthcare provider. The healthcare professional provides these details via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.Record payer enrollment details of healthcare professional. The healthcare professional provides these details via the profile intake forms in Employee Center.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-hc-profile.html","release":"australia","product":"HR Service Delivery for Healthcare","classification":"hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":8,"breadcrumb":["Using HR Service Delivery for Healthcare","HR Service Delivery for Healthcare","HR Service Delivery","Employee Service Management"],"tags":["#employee-service-management","#hrsd","#healthcare","#industry","#hr","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery-for-healthcare/hr-hc-profile.md"},
